e><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI HIDEYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYA, KAZUYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, HIDETOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI, HIDEYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYA KAZUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI HIDETOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI HIDEYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYA, KAZUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, HIDETOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI, HIDEYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A switching control unit (204) receives mode information representing whether the present state of the station is in an initial synchronization mode of when the power is turned on or in a standby mode of when a cell is moving, and controls a switch (205) and a switch (211) so that correlation may be done by a matched filter (209) in the initial synchronization mode and by a sliding correlator (210) in the standby mode.  In the CDMA radio communication system, therefore, the initial synchronization can be established in a short time while reducing the current consumption.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Dans cette invention, un dispositif (204) de commande de commutation reçoit des informations de mode représentatives de l'état actuel de la station en mode de synchronisation initiale lorsque le courant est établi, ou en mode d'attente lorsqu'une cellule est en déplacement. Ce dispositif de commande de commutation commande un premier commutateur (205) et un second commutateur (211) pour que la corrélation puisse être effectuée par un filtre correspondant (209) dans le mode de synchronisation initiale, et par un corrélateur coulissant (210) dans le mode d'attente. Ainsi, on peut effectuer en peu de temps la synchronisation initiale dans le système de radiocommunication AMCR, tout en réduisant la consommation de courant.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>